A paragraph opened after a block in an item is still open for a lazy line

```
- > | a |
  + b |
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>
      <table>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>a</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </blockquote>
    + b |
tail
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- | a |
  b
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <table>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>a</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    b
tail
  </li>
</ul>
```

````
- ```
  c
  ```
  b
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <pre><code>c
</code></pre>
    b
tail
  </li>
</ul>
````

```
- | a |
  b

tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <table>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>a</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    b
  </li>
</ul>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
- | a |
  | b |
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <table>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>a</td></tr>
        <tr><td>b</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>tail</p>
```
